ved tag \\\"noise-cancelling\\\" still returns Sony WH-1000XM5 — search matches the old tags, not the saved set.\", \"evidence\": \"Detail page chips: headphones, wireless-pro, premium, ldac-audio. /products?search=ldac-audio → 0; search \\\"noise-cancelling\\\" → 1 (Sony).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created \\\"Zephyr Air Purifier Z9\\\" with Category select set to \\\"Home Goods\\\" (single-select dropdown, exactly one category). After saving it appears on /category/home with badge \\\"Home\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /products the category select filtered correctly: Tech Gadgets → \\\"3 products found\\\" (all Tech), Fitness → \\\"3 products found\\\" (all Fitness), Home Goods → \\\"4 products found\\\" (all Home). Counts and visible products updated together.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-9\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/products lists all 10 products (\\\"10 products found\\\"); each article exposes image, category badge, price, name link, brief description, star rating value and a \\\"Buy Now\\\" link to the retailer URL.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Sort: Newest (default), Top Rated (4.9→4.4 descending), Price Low→High (199→2495), Price High→Low (2495→199) all ordered correctly. Price Range dual slider: dragging max to $2410 removed Peloton ($2,495) → 8 results. Minimum Rating \\\"4.5+ stars\\\" → 7 results, all ratings ≥4.5 (Philips Hue 4.4 excluded).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-19\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Product additions are not persisted across page reload\", \"actual\": \"Created \\\"Zephyr Air Purifier Z9\\\" via /admin (confirmed visible in admin list, /products, /category/home and its detail page). After reloading /admin the admin list contains only the 9 seeded products and 