roduct articles. No unrelated product data shown.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"On /products, typing in the search box, changing the category select, changing the sort select, dragging the price slider and choosing a minimum rating each immediately updated the rendered product set, its order and the \\\"N products found\\\" counter with no page reload (URL/document unchanged).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicking the card image of \\\"Theragun Pro Gen5\\\" on /products navigated to /product/theragun-pro-gen5 showing that same product. Clicking product name headings (\\\"Zephyr Air Purifier Z9\\\", \\\"Sony WH-1000XM5\\\") likewise opened their matching detail pages; both image and name links share the same /product/&lt;slug&gt; href.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Purchase links point to placeholder example.com URLs, not real retailer product pages\", \"actual\": \"\\\"Buy Now\\\" correctly opens an external site in a new tab (target=_blank, rel=noopener noreferrer) — clicking it opened tab 1 at https://example.com/theragun-gen5 titled \\\"Example Domain\\\". However every seeded product's affiliate link is an example.com placeholder (https://example.com/sony-xm5, /peloton, /dyson-v15, /macbook-pro, /s24-ultra, /philips-hue, /breville, /theragun, /bowflex), so no purchase action reaches an actual retailer's product page.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category dropdown on category pages is inert\", \"actual\": \"On /category/home the toolbar offers a category select pre-set to \\\"Home Goods\\\". Selecting \\\"Fitness\\\" (and separately \\\"Tech Gadgets\\\") from its listbox has no effect: URL stays /category/home, H1 stays \\\"Home Goods\\\", the select trigger still reads \\\"Home Goods\\\", and the same 4 Home products remain displayed. (The equivalent select on /products does work.)\", \"evidence\": \"After clicking option \\\"Tech Gadgets\\\": {url:/category/home, h1:\\\"Home Goods\\\", trigger:\\\"Home Goods\\\", names:[Zephyr, Breville, Philips Hue, Dyson]}\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Visited all 9 seeded detail pages plus the admin-created one. Each shows category badge, star rating value, H1 name, brief description, price, \\\"Buy Now\\\" retailer link (target=_blank, rel=noopener noreferrer), tag chips, \\\"Key Specifications\\\" label/value list, product image, and a \\\"My Review\\\" section. E.g. Dyson V15 Detect: Home / 4.7 / $749 / vacuum,cordless,smart-home,cleaning / 5 specs (Runtime, Bin Volume, Weight, Suction Power, Filtration) / https://example.com/dyson-v15.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Categories and tags are topically relevant and identical between list cards and detail pages for all 9 seeded products: Tech — Samsung(smartphone,android,camera,flagship), MacBook(laptop,apple,professional,portable), Sony(headphones,wireless,noise-cancelling,premium); Home — Dyson(vacuum,cordless,smart-home,cleaning), Philips Hue(lighting,smart-home,ambiance,automation), Breville(coffee,espresso,kitchen,appliance); Fitness — Peloton(cardio,cycling,smart-equipment,subscription), Theragun(recovery,massage,muscle,therapy), Bowflex(weights,dumbbells,strength,home-gym). Category badges match on homepage, /products, /category/* and detail pages.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Name/category/price/rating/brief description are byte-identical across homepage sections, /category/* pages, /products cards and detail pages for all 9 products (e.g. Sony WH-1000XM5 / Tech / $399 / 4.8 / \\\"Industry-leading noise cancellation…\\\" everywhere). Detail pages render the full review untruncate